claim.claim-text:
forming a tunnel layer (20) on a side of a substrate (10);
forming an initial stack structure (30) on a side of the tunnel layer (20) away from the substrate (10), wherein the initial stack structure (30) comprises polysilicon layers (310) and a doped layer (320) alternately stacked with each other, in the initial stack structure (30), an innermost layer is a layer most adjacent to the tunnel layer (20), an outermost layer is a layer most away from the tunnel layer (20), the innermost layer and the outermost layer are two of the polysilicon layers (310), and the doped layer (320) is a polysilicon material layer doped with a dopant; and
activating the dopant in the doped layer (320), such that the dopant diffuses into the polysilicon layers (310), thereby transforming the initial stack structure (30) into a doped stack structure (40) with uniform distribution of the dopant.

a first passivation layer (60) disposed on a side of the passivating contact structure away from the tunnel layer (20);
wherein the substrate (10) comprises a first surface and a second surface opposite to each other, and the passivating contact structure is disposed on the second surface; the solar cell further comprises:
a second passivation layer (70) disposed on the first surface of the substrate (10).
